/node_modules

# ⚠ NEXT.JS BUILD OUTPUT. This was missing when the repo moved from Vite to
# Next.js — the old file ignored `/dist/`, which Next does not produce — and 377
# generated files were committed before anyone noticed. Build output in git is
# merge conflicts on every branch and a diff nobody can review.
/.next
/out
next-env.d.ts

